        "created_at": "2025-07-07T15:33:39.644594+00:00",
        "notes": "Flying Kick lets you put out more damage up close and gives a little extra mobility. Lumerico Fusion Drive sadly doesn't work when Zen applies Orb of Harmony or Orb of Discord but it does work with your Flying Kick ability so when you melee dive a target Drive will trigger ontop of the Martian Mender and Inner Peace passives you already have giving you even more regen. When you Flying Kick someone remember to have Discord on them first and keep in mind the environment behind them to proc the stun effect of Flying Kick. Kick can also be used to quick dodge when disengaging which will trigger Drive so you won't have to out of the fight for too long and if someone chases they will be in for a surprise when you already back at full health. If your pockets are heavy I listed Satya's Solution and Hiking Hoverboots as optional buys for extra movement speed, definitely get hoverboots if you can.",
