        "cash_earned": 0,
        "created_at": "2025-07-07T15:33:40.186328+00:00",
        "notes": "Instant Karma is good for you guessed it even more life regen, remember though it only works on whoever you have Discord on and they have to be actively damaging you. Vanadium Injection is a boost in almost everything but ONLY if you have AND hold onto your ULTIMATE so you might have to start being a little selfish here but the increase in stats especially movement speed, health, and shields is well worth it without sacrificing item space or extra cash. Divine Intervention is a outstanding item in this build as it counters huge single target damage like Cass, Ashe viper, Freja explosive bolts or Rein fire strike. When Divine Intervention does trigger it will be triggering ontop of potentially 5 five other regen effects so if should feel like getting a full restore after surviving a super effective attack. Divine Intervention is only listed as optional because I feel like Vanadium Injection's stat, health, and shield boost is a better buy but if your against high single instance damage take Intervention. I don't know how I feel about Overdrive Core but it can save your life if you make a bad play so I have it listed as optional as well.",
